{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gate_stone","model_identifier":"gate_stone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gate_stone\n\nStone gate, twice as wide in Patch 5: six columns (96 u) along X. Two stone piers with plinths, quoins and arrow slits, a flat arch with voussoirs and a keystone under a battlemented upper wall, and two dark plank doors with iron bands, ring handles and hinge straps. Opening 72 u wide x 90 u tall. Leaves hinged at the jambs (`leaf_l` at x -37, `leaf_r` at x +37) open inward (+Z). Clips `open` and `close`.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 1 columns (96 x 16 units, 2.70 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -48..48, y -1..145, z -10..9 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 125, construction_0 25, construction_33 71, construction_66 123, ruined 56 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `gate_stone_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- jambs: two 12 x 145 x 16 boxes at x -42 / +42\n- leaves (when closed): 72 x 92 x 4 at the origin; open leaves do not block\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing about 95 degrees inward (+Z) and hold open. |\n| `close` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing shut and hold. |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -16)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"stone_pier_l#aba79d","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-47.6,0,-8],"to":[-36,134,8],"autouv":0,"color":2,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[64,0,76,134],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,0,16,134],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[76,0,88,134],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[16,0,32,134],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[378,134,390,150],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[390,134,402,150],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"68067a29-c560-9dce-fa2b-f101223e6c08"},{"name":"stone_plinth_l#8f8b83","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48,-1,-8.6],"to":[-36.4,10,8.6],"autouv":0,"color":2,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[440,169,452,180],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[372,169,389,180],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[452,169,464,180],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[389,169,406,180],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[262,134,274,151],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[274,134,286,151],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"16492911-aeac-f1de-4f1f-fb66c13dfb76"},{"name":"stone_quoin_l_o0#8f8b83","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-47.9,11,-8.4],"to":[-44.3,17,-7.2],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,191,10,197],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[174,191,175,197],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10,191,14,197],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[175,191,176,197],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[264,218,268,219],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[268,218,272,219],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"15303ad2-3a71-d1bb-e841-99730f12c611"},{"name":"stone_quoin_l_i0#8f8b83","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-39.3,11,-8.4],"to":[-35.7,17,-7.2],"autouv":0,"color":